## Quick Reference: Common Moodle Tables

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `{user}` | User accounts |
| `{course}` | Courses |
| `{course_modules}` | Activity instances in courses |
| `{modules}` | Available activity types (quiz, forum, etc.) |
